Invariant: serviceCategory-location-type
Description: "For serviceCategory 27 or 30, every contained Location must have type HU or HOSP, and at least one HU and one HOSP Location must be present."
* severity = #error
* expression = "serviceCategory.coding.where(code = '27' or code = '30').empty() or (contained.ofType(Location).all(type.coding.where(system = 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode' and (code = 'HU' or code = 'HOSP')).exists()) and contained.ofType(Location).where(type.coding.where(system = 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode' and code = 'HU').exists()).exists() and contained.ofType(Location).where(type.coding.where(system = 'http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode' and code = 'HOSP').exists()).exists())"